<title>USA: Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended Nov 2 totalled 125.401 million, versus a revised 130.072 million in the previous week and 127.500 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.</p>
<p>Eggs set in those states in the same week totalled 158.698 million, versus a revised 150.980 million the previous week and 156.840 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
